# Wanwan, Agile Tiger

> Wanwan is not a marksman who farms and wins by existing. She is a draft bet that says you can flank the enemy carry four times, hit every weakness, and cash the ultimate before a suppression lands. When that bet is wrong, her ult feels like a decoration on a squishy body.

