## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Gold Lane Default (Gold)

- Items: Swift Boots, Corrosion Scythe, Demon Hunter Sword, Golden Staff, Malefic Gun, Wind of Nature
- Core: Corrosion Scythe, Demon Hunter Sword, Golden Staff
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Swift, Weapon Master, Weakness Finder
- Battle spell: Inspire
- Flex: Windtalker over Malefic Gun when Use when wave clear and cheap attack speed matter more than extra range against short engage.; Rose Gold Meteor over Wind of Nature when Use against magic or mixed burst where physical immunity will not stop the first collapse.; Sea Halberd over Malefic Gun when Use when healing, shielding, or high-extra-HP bruisers keep the marked target alive through Crossbow of Tang.
- Total cost: 10970 gold

Default ranked setup that rushes Wanwan's attack-speed engine, then adds range and one physical-burst answer for the first decisive ultimate.

### Front-to-Back Anti-Tank (Gold)

- Items: Swift Boots, Corrosion Scythe, Demon Hunter Sword, Golden Staff, Sea Halberd, Malefic Roar
- Core: Corrosion Scythe, Demon Hunter Sword, Golden Staff
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Swift, Weapon Master, Weakness Finder
- Battle spell: Inspire
- Flex: Malefic Gun over Malefic Roar when Use when the enemy has moderate armor but range control matters more than scaling penetration.; Wind of Nature over Malefic Roar when Use if a physical diver can bypass your front line before you finish opening the first target.; Windtalker over Sea Halberd when Use when the enemy front line is durable but not protected by healing, shields, or high-extra-HP sustain.
- Total cost: 11050 gold

Tank-breaking setup for grouped fights where Wanwan can work through the nearest durable target before chasing resets.

### Burst Insurance (Gold)

- Items: Tough Boots, Corrosion Scythe, Demon Hunter Sword, Golden Staff, Rose Gold Meteor, Immortality
- Core: Corrosion Scythe, Demon Hunter Sword, Golden Staff
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Swift, Weapon Master, Weakness Finder
- Battle spell: Aegis
- Flex: Wind of Nature over Rose Gold Meteor when Use when the main threat is physical burst and you can time Wind Chant before the lethal hit.; Athena's Shield over Immortality when Use against front-loaded magic burst that decides the fight before a revive can matter.; Radiant Armor over Immortality when Use against repeated magic damage that chips Wanwan before every objective fight.
- Total cost: 10870 gold

Defensive setup for burst-heavy drafts where living long enough to expose all weaknesses is worth more than a greedy sixth damage slot.

